  "description": "Eleanor, a beta nobleman, finally weds his beloved Fenrir—but his joy is short-lived. Unable to bear children, he becomes a source of shame to the family and, overcome with despair, throws himself from a window. But instead of death, he wakes up as an omega… on the morning of his wedding day. With no idea how or why he’s turned back time—or changed sexes—Eleanor must navigate a new reality where his body, instincts, and even his relationship with Fenrir are shifting. As if that weren’t enough, three powerful alphas begin circling him with growing interest. In this second life, will Eleanor protect his love… or be swept into an entirely new destiny?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
